      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documentation is required for a corporate office shift with Packers And Movers In Chitragupta Nagar Patna?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">For a corporate move, you’ll need a valid GST registration certificate, the e‑Way bill for goods in transit, a signed service agreement, and a detailed inventory list. If the relocation involves government or PSU assets, additional clearance letters may be required. Our team assists in preparing all paperwork to ensure a smooth, audit‑ready transfer.</p>
