        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does Shree Ashirwad ensure zero‑downtime for server and IT equipment during relocation?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ climate‑controlled containers, anti‑static cushioning, and real‑time GPS monitoring. Prior to transit, a dedicated IT specialist conducts a pre‑move audit, labels each rack, and creates a step‑by‑step reconnection plan. On‑site technicians oversee loading and unloading, guaranteeing that servers are powered up within the agreed window.</p>
