      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I claim the moving expense on my corporate GST return?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Our services are GST‑compliant and the invoice includes a clear breakdown of taxable and non‑taxable components. The GST rate applied follows the latest government notification for relocation services. You can claim the input tax credit on your GST return, provided you retain the original invoice and e‑Way bill.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is included for high‑value office assets?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">All moves are covered by an IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance that protects declared values up to 100 % of the asset cost. For high‑value items such as servers, artwork, or specialized machinery, we recommend declaring the exact value to secure full coverage. Any excess can be managed through optional supplemental policies.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the live GPS tracking system work for long‑haul moves from Chitragupta Nagar to other hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Each container truck is equipped with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams real‑time location data to our control center. Clients receive a secure link to monitor progress, view estimated arrival times, and receive alerts for any route deviations. This transparency ensures accountability and allows you to plan office setup accordingly.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there any hidden charges when shifting office furniture and equipment?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Our pricing model is fully transparent. The quote includes vehicle type, distance, loading/unloading labor, packaging materials, insurance, and applicable GST. Additional charges only arise for optional services such as disassembly/reassembly of modular furniture, special handling of heavy machinery, or expedited delivery requests, all of which are disclosed upfront.</p>
      </div>
